sented an increase in the annual number of cases\"}]}, {\"v\": \"guidance or recommendations\", \"ev\": [{\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"public health agencies should broadly disseminate evidence-based information on PAM in their recommendations for healthy swimming\"}]}], \"methods_quotes\": [{\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"Cases were included if laboratory-confirmed detection of N. fowleri organisms or nucleic acid was reported in CSF, biopsy, or tissue specimens.\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"Among the 119 cases for which sex of the patient was known, males accounted for 93 (78%) of the cases.\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"Results were verified with public health officials from the state of diagnosis\"}], \"confidence\": \"medium\", \"uncertain_fields\": [\"study_design\", \"analytic_depth\"]}", "type": "text"}]}